<title>USA: Vivus asks for reinspection of plant.</title>
<headline>Vivus asks for reinspection of plant.</headline>
<dateline>MENLO PARK, Calif. 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vivus Inc said Wednesday it has requested the Food and Drug Administration reinspect its manufacturing plant in New Jersey.</p>
<p>The company said it has worked to correct the deficiencies observed during a routine FDA inspection in February and March.</p>
<p>It said the New Jersey plant continues to produce the MUSE treatment for erectile dysfunction at maximum capacity.</p>
</text>
